    "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate began 2021 with gross claims outstanding of GBP 355.5m. During the year there was favourable prior-year development on older years (notably 2018 and prior) resulting in a gross release of approximately GBP 18.5m, driven by favourable claims development, improved reinsurance recoveries and IBNR recalibration. Releases were concentrated in a mix of long-tail casualty and short-tail accounts (including improvement in a large Irish motor account). Key catastrophe events during the period (e.g. Hurricane Ida, Winterstorm Uri) materially affected the open years but were largely mitigated by the reinsurance programme.",
